    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "One think I really like about folke's todo-comments is the ability to put todos in a quickfix list or telescope finder. I ended up writing my own mini.pick finder that lets me choose todos from todo-comments.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to get a list of matched items for a given set of highlighters from mini.hipatterns? Once the list of matches (plus location) is in hand its easy enough to pipe them to mini.pick or a qf list or whatever.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">One think I really like about folke's todo-comments is the ability to put todos in a quickfix list or telescope finder. I ended up writing my own mini.pick finder that lets me choose todos from todo-comments.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would it be possible to get a list of matched items for a given set of highlighters from mini.hipatterns? Once the list of matches (plus location) is in hand its easy enough to pipe them to mini.pick or a qf list or whatever.</p>",
    "bodyText": "One think I really like about folke's todo-comments is the ability to put todos in a quickfix list or telescope finder. I ended up writing my own mini.pick finder that lets me choose todos from todo-comments.\nWould it be possible to get a list of matched items for a given set of highlighters from mini.hipatterns? Once the list of matches (plus location) is in hand its easy enough to pipe them to mini.pick or a qf list or whatever.",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
