            "body": "@BeauSLM, thanks again for the suggestion! It prompted me thinking about the best way to do this, and after couple of refactor rounds this is now possible with [`get_matches()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/7af4878bd0b19fcef385e45715f418165eff1218/doc/mini-hipatterns.txt#L389).\r\n\r\nAs a heads up, here is how it can be used in a picker (which will be a part of an upcoming 'mini.extra' module):\r\n\r\n![screenshot_2023-10-24_15:36:07](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/24854248/6f5db8d0-6cc7-4272-979a-85e8aa8f419f)",
