                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Highlights are created inside custom `source.show()` with extmarks using items' `hl_group` field.\r\n\r\nHere is the [full source](https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/695583ce6b5e918813423663fd04f69b29a605f0/lua/mini-dev/extra.lua#L904-L949). Beware that the exported functionality and names might change.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Highlights are created inside custom <code class=\"notranslate\">source.show()</code> with extmarks using items' <code class=\"notranslate\">hl_group</code> field.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here is the <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/nvim/blob/695583ce6b5e918813423663fd04f69b29a605f0/lua/mini-dev/extra.lua#L904-L949\">full source</a>. Beware that the exported functionality and names might change.</p>",
